==Cat Fortune==
[[File:Fortune.png|thumb|right]]

Each time the player has their fortune told, they will be shown a "Your Fortune" screen with five lines of text. The first line is the player's perceived luck (Disaster, Bad Luck, No Luck, Li'l Luck, Good Luck, Super Luck and Uber Luck). See [[Gamatoto Expedition#Item Pack]] for Great Fortunes' rewards compared to normal Item Packs.

===Drop Rates===
'''Uber Luck''': 40% Inari, 40% Great Fortune, 20% Leadership<br>
'''Super Luck''': 35% Inari, 35% Great Fortune, 30% Leadership<br>
'''Li'l Luck''': 30% Inari, 30% Great Fortune, 30% Leadership<br>
'''No Luck''': 20% Inari, 20% Great Fortune, 20% Leadership<br>
'''Bad Luck''': 15% Inari, 15% Great Fortune, 20% Leadership<br>
'''Disaster''': 10% Inari, 10% Great Fortune, 20% Leadership

